OL,3,AFormer Venezuelan President Nicolas
OL,4,AMaduro expected to face more charges
OL,5,Athis week
OL,6,
OL,7,FFederal prosecutors are expected to
OL,8,Fbring additional charges against former
OL,9,FVenezuelan President Nicolas Maduro and
OL,10,Fhis wife Cilia Flores, the BBC's US
OL,11,Fmedia partner CBS has reported.
OL,13,FThe new charges accuse them of playing
OL,14,Fa role in the torture of Americans who
OL,15,Fwere held in Venezuelan prisons,
OL,16,Faccording to CBS.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
