OL,3,AFormer Venezuelan President Nicolas
OL,4,AMaduro expected to face more charges
OL,5,Athis week
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS forces seized Maduro and Flores from
OL,8,Ftheir compound in the Venezuelan
OL,9,Fcapital, Caracas, in a dramatic,
OL,10,Fnight-time raid on 3 January, and
OL,11,Fbrought them to New York to face
OL,12,Fcharges for alleged weapon and drug
OL,13,Foffences, which they deny.
OL,15,FThe BBC has contacted Maduro's lawyer
OL,16,Ffor comment as well as the US
OL,17,FAttorney's office in Manhattan b@Kwhich
OL,18,Fbrought the charges.
